# Anywhere in the tree, not only at the root: a node_modules installed on Windows (src/nInvoices.Web) would
# otherwise be copied over the container's own install, and a package that only exists in that stale copy
# (a previous Vite's Rollup) has no Linux binary there.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.env
.env.local

# Local build output: Windows restore files break the Linux build, and bin/ can hold
# hundreds of MB (e.g. the headless Chrome PuppeteerSharp downloads for local PDFs)
**/bin
**/obj

# Local runtime data
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db.bak*
**/logs
